{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンバーガーどーん\nいえーすアメリカーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写の撮影中は\nピクルス頬張ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46オフィシャルアメブロ\n46ブロ更新してあるので、\n読んでねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvの感想\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動した\nというコメントが多くて\n嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はみなさんがこれを見て\nいろんな考えてくださったことに\n感動しました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んだあとにpv見返した！\n考え方がそれぞれ違って面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、前回の訂正で...\n雰囲気に合ってるじゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雰囲気に溶け込めたらいいな\nと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またひとつ学ぶことできました。\n監督さんに感謝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メモ用紙と手紙は直筆です！\nくまの絵で遊んだところが\n使われてて嬉しかった。\n絵がちっちゃくて見えにくいけど、\nこんな感じの落書きでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1枚目                  2枚目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(再現)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナタリーバック8グラビア第二弾の\n感想もありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ていない方は↓\nhttp://natalie.mu/music/pp/nogizaka46back8_02/page/8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入りの一枚はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はしたから撮ったロフトのすきー\nあったかいオレンジの明かり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日経エンタテインメント！\nネクストメジャー・アイドルSpecial\n17人表紙だーーひゃーあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人ひとりのインタビューが\n2ページずつ！盛りだくさんです。\nこちらも見てね見てねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今テスト期間\n真っ最中のひめかと私...\nひゃーあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/12/03/7951772/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく、\n今日一日のことを思い出してみよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......そうだな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみがグミみたいな顔したのが\n印象的な一日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はFNS歌謡祭。\nよろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}